# the same program with escape analysis withheld: the cell has no byte, and nobody proposes to hand it back
# RUN: walk f1 mechanisms=-EscapeAnalysis
# CHECK-LABEL: code f1:Body
# CHECK: = NewObject {{*}}layout=L0
# RUN(NEVER): walk f1 mechanisms=-EscapeAnalysis
# NEVER-NOT: ReleaseEnvironment
# NEVER-NOT: MarkEnvironmentEscaped
# PROGRAM-OF: environment-that-only-direct-callees-are-handed-is-handed-back.ir
